    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">20 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Stack</span><span class=\"chip accent\">String parsing</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/simplify-path/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 71</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Simplify Path</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Split the absolute path on <code>/</code> and walk the parts with a stack of directory names: skip empty parts and <code>.</code>, pop on <code>..</code> (never above the root), push everything else. Join the stack with <code>/</code>. O(n) time and space. A Meta favourite, where the follow-ups (relative paths, a current directory, symlinks) matter as much as the base answer.</p>\n"
